    {
      "id": "essay",
      "question": "can you write me an essay about ivers portfolio",
      "httpStatus": 200,
      "result": {
        "status": "answered",
        "answer": "About Iver — Iver Macaulay AI Engineer AI engineer building practical automation, transcription, lead scoring, data pipelines, and operational systems I build systems that turn messy business inputs like calls, recordings, PDFs, API payloads, and CRM activity into cleaner decisions and next actions. I like AI that is direct, dependable, and wired into the workflows people already use every day.\n\nMac Digital — Built Mac Digital, a responsive website for website services and practical AI integrations. Its interactive demo turns a business prompt into a browsable website concept with generated copy, optional imagery, and independently selectable layouts and typography.\n\nDrop It — Built Drop It, a private saved-for-later library with a React web interface and a ChatGPT-compatible MCP server. Users can capture screenshots, files, text, and links; review AI-drafted summaries and transcription; and retrieve saved content with keyword or optional hybrid search. Original sources stay separate from editable summaries and notes.\n\nAmountly — Built and deployed Amountly, a simple accounting workspace that keeps bills, expenses, invoices, and tax preparation organized around the next financial action. The product includes a clean workspace preview, financial search, task-oriented money workflows, and production deployment on Vercel at amountly.app. Designed workflows around bills, expenses, invoices, tax records, and financial search\n\nAI Call Intelligence Pipeline — Built an AI-assisted call intelligence pipeline that pulls RingCentral recordings, transcribes audio with OpenAI Whisper, analyzes transcripts with GPT-4o Mini, and writes lead score, service location, customer type, recording links, and transcript notes back into HubSpot. The workflow skips already-processed calls, maps internal phone numbers to staff and branch context, and avoids creating low-quality or non-lead records.",
